  "description": "I got the idea from Swaggy's video where he rushes Feudal Age with Great Pastures to make iron pagodas very early.\nBut, since iron pagodas take so long to produce, I decided to make horsemen first instead before transitioning to mohe tribesmen.\n\nThe goal is to mess up the opponent's plan faster than any other civilization can, blocking resources and forcing them to react by spending resources on spearmen and archers.\n\nThis doesn't work against civilizations with heavy cavalry in Feudal Age (French, Jeanne D'Arc, Rus or Golden Horde). It also doesn't work against English, Lancaster or Abbasyd (military wing).\n\nCheck my other Jin Dinasty guides:\n- 2 TC: https://aoe4guides.com/builds/cVmyoYJZ7MFxVg1MGiu8",
